selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1fnl3a7","name":"X：通义千问 / Qwen (@Alibaba_Qwen)","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-05T04:01:34.769Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"Qwen3.5在TokenSpeed推理引擎上，针对智能体工作负载达到了创纪录的580 tokens per second (tps)速度。这一成果由通义千问推理团队、lightseekorg Foundation TokenSpeed团队、NVIDIA及Mooncake团队共同实现，并采用了tri_dao的FlashAttention-4 (FA4) 优化。此里程碑标志着开源大语言模型推理性能的边界得到了推动，相关详情可查阅PyTorch社区博客。","reportEdition":"2026-05-28","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpobyo1b04qeslv4jzefv5eu","title":"ITBench-AA：前沿大模型在首个智能体企业IT任务基准测试中得分均低于50%","topic":"研究","publishedAt":"2026-05-28T00:00:00.348Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmpobyo1b04qeslv4jzefv5eu","https://huggingface.co/blog/ibm-research/itbench-aa"],"articles":[{"id":"cmpobyo1b04qeslv4jzefv5eu","title":"ITBench-AA：前沿大模型在首个智能体企业IT任务基准测试中得分均低于50%","originalTitle":"","summary":"由Artificial Analysis和IBM推出的ITBench-AA SRE基准测试显示，所有前沿大模型得分均未超过50%。Claude Opus 4.7（自适应推理，最大努力）以47%领先，GPT-5.5（xhigh）和Qwen3.7 Max分别得46%和42%。该测试包含59个需要通过Shell命令调查Kubernetes事件快照并提交根因诊断的智能体任务。关键发现是模型推理轮次差异近3倍，但更长的轨迹并不转化为更高准确率，过度调查的模型会因提交误报而受罚。在成本方面，开源模型Gemma 4 31B（Reasoning）以每任务$0.14的成本获得37%得分，优于成本更高但得分更低的闭源模型。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpobyo1b04qeslv4jzefv5eu","originalUrl":"https://huggingface.co/blog/ibm-research/itbench-aa","publishedAt":"2026-05-28T00:00:00.348Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-rb89q4","originalSourceName":"Hugging Face 社区博客（混合发现）","family":"outlet-1ohup8a","kind":"community","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpobyo1b04qeslv4jzefv5eu","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-05T04:01:34.769Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-rb89q4","name":"Hugging Face 社区博客（混合发现）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-05T04:01:34.769Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"由Artificial Analysis和IBM推出的ITBench-AA SRE基准测试显示，所有前沿大模型得分均未超过50%。Claude Opus 4.7（自适应推理，最大努力）以47%领先，GPT-5.5（xhigh）和Qwen3.7 Max分别得46%和42%。该测试包含59个需要通过Shell命令调查Kubernetes事件快照并提交根因诊断的智能体任务。关键发现是模型推理轮次差异近3倍，但更长的轨迹并不转化为更高准确率，过度调查的模型会因提交误报而受罚。在成本方面，开源模型Gemma 4 31B（Reasoning）以每任务$0.14的成本获得37%得分，优于成本更高但得分更低的闭源模型。","reportEdition":"2026-05-28","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpocftbm04v2slv4qabfidb6","title":"通过零信任聚合实现的隐私分析","topic":"研究","publishedAt":"2026-05-28T00:00:00.348Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmpocftbm04v2slv4qabfidb6","https://research.google/blog/private-analytics-via-zero-trust-aggregation"],"articles":[{"id":"cmpocftbm04v2slv4qabfidb6","title":"通过零信任聚合实现的隐私分析","originalTitle":"","summary":"Google Research 推出了一种新的隐私分析解决方案。该方案结合了一种新的密码学安全聚合协议与可信执行环境（TEE）的透明性，旨在实现前沿的隐私与安全保证。其核心是基于零信任原则，通过密码学与硬件保护的结合，确保系统仅能获取群体的匿名化聚合洞察。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpocftbm04v2slv4qabfidb6","originalUrl":"https://research.google/blog/private-analytics-via-zero-trust-aggregation","publishedAt":"2026-05-28T00:00:00.348Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-u8es94","originalSourceName":"Google Research：Blog（网页）","family":"google","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpocftbm04v2slv4qabfidb6","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-05T04:01:34.769Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-u8es94","name":"Google Research：Blog（网页）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-05T04:01:34.769Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"Google Research 推出了一种新的隐私分析解决方案。该方案结合了一种新的密码学安全聚合协议与可信执行环境（TEE）的透明性，旨在实现前沿的隐私与安全保证。其核心是基于零信任原则，通过密码学与硬件保护的结合，确保系统仅能获取群体的匿名化聚合洞察。","reportEdition":"2026-05-28","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpoocnzn07snslv4ur3wipc5","title":"社会科学中的编码智能体","topic":"研究","publishedAt":"2026-05-28T00:00:00.348Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmpoocnzn07snslv4ur3wipc5","https://www.anthropic.com/research/coding-agents-social-sciences"],"articles":[{"id":"cmpoocnzn07snslv4ur3wipc5","title":"社会科学中的编码智能体","originalTitle":"","summary":"一项针对1260名定量社会科学家的调查显示，虽然81%的受访者用过AI聊天机器人，但仅有20%将Claude Code、Codex等编码智能体常规应用于工作。采用率存在显著差异：以男性名字命名的研究者使用率是女性研究者的两倍；顶尖大学研究者可能性高出40%。用户产出更多工作论文和基金申请，但这可能反映早期采用者自身差异。研究者对AI助力撰写可发表论文更乐观，但对重塑整个社会科学领域持保留态度。这是一项初步调查，更深入研究仍在进行中。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpoocnzn07snslv4ur3wipc5","originalUrl":"https://www.anthropic.com/research/coding-agents-social-sciences","publishedAt":"2026-05-28T00:00:00.348Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-14mqazp","originalSourceName":"Anthropic：Research（发表成果 · 网页）","family":"anthropic","kind":"official","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpoocnzn07snslv4ur3wipc5","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-05T04:01:34.769Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-14mqazp","name":"Anthropic：Research（发表成果 · 网页）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-05T04:01:34.769Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"一项针对1260名定量社会科学家的调查显示，虽然81%的受访者用过AI聊天机器人，但仅有20%将Claude Code、Codex等编码智能体常规应用于工作。采用率存在显著差异：以男性名字命名的研究者使用率是女性研究者的两倍；顶尖大学研究者可能性高出40%。用户产出更多工作论文和基金申请，但这可能反映早期采用者自身差异。研究者对AI助力撰写可发表论文更乐观，但对重塑整个社会科学领域持保留态度。这是一项初步调查，更深入研究仍在进行中。","reportEdition":"2026-05-28","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpom802q07ajslv4d651ko6o","title":"使用大语言模型保障源代码安全","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-05-28T00:00:00.348Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmpom802q07ajslv4d651ko6o","https://claude.com/blog/using-llms-to-secure-source-code"],"articles":[{"id":"cmpom802q07ajslv4d651ko6o","title":"使用大语言模型保障源代码安全","originalTitle":"","summary":"本文分享了使用 Claude Opus 构建威胁模型、发现代码漏洞并进行验证、分类和修复的最佳实践。其核心流程是一个六步循环：威胁建模、沙箱隔离、漏洞发现、验证、分类和修复。作者指出，漏洞发现现在易于并行化，瓶颈已转移到后续的验证与处理阶段。以他们对开源软件的扫描为例，截至2026年5月22日已披露1,596个漏洞，其中97个已修补。指南建议结合代码库文档和专家访谈来构建准确的威胁模型，以降低误报，提升发现的可利用性。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpom802q07ajslv4d651ko6o","originalUrl":"https://claude.com/blog/using-llms-to-secure-source-code","publishedAt":"2026-05-28T00:00:00.348Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1ckykuf","originalSourceName":"Claude：Blog（网页）","family":"anthropic","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpom802q07ajslv4d651ko6o","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-05T04:01:34.769Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1ckykuf","name":"Claude：Blog（网页）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-05T04:01:34.769Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"本文分享了使用 Claude Opus 构建威胁模型、发现代码漏洞并进行验证、分类和修复的最佳实践。其核心流程是一个六步循环：威胁建模、沙箱隔离、漏洞发现、验证、分类和修复。作者指出，漏洞发现现在易于并行化，瓶颈已转移到后续的验证与处理阶段。以他们对开源软件的扫描为例，截至2026年5月22日已披露1,596个漏洞，其中97个已修补。指南建议结合代码库文档和专家访谈来构建准确的威胁模型，以降低误报，提升发现的可利用性。","reportEdition":"2026-05-28","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpoche1204w5slv4kd4tnio9","title":"我认为 Anthropic 和 OpenAI 找到了产品市场契合点","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-05-28T00:00:00.348Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmpoche1204w5slv4kd4tnio9","https://simonwillison.net/2026/May/27/product-market-fit"],"articles":[{"id":"cmpoche1204w5slv4kd4tnio9","title":"我认为 Anthropic 和 OpenAI 找到了产品市场契合点","originalTitle":"","summary":"Anthropic 与 OpenAI 通过编程智能体找到了产品市场契合点，这导致企业客户成本显著上升。两家公司已于 2026 年 4 月前后调整了企业套餐定价，从原先的高额折扣改为与 API 用量挂钩。Anthropic Enterprise 套餐变为每席位 20 美元/月外加 API 费用，OpenAI Codex 则按 API token 用量计费。同期发布的新模型 GPT-5.5（4月23日）和 Opus 4.7（4月16日）的 API 定价也显著高于前代版本。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpoche1204w5slv4kd4tnio9","originalUrl":"https://simonwillison.net/2026/May/27/product-market-fit","publishedAt":"2026-05-28T00:00:00.348Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1h6icyw","originalSourceName":"Simon Willison 博客","family":"outlet-1q8zliy","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/